<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BOGDANOVIC JOINS ATLETICO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOGDANOVIC JOINS ATLETICO.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslav international striker Rade Bogdanovic has joined Spain's Atletico Madrid for 150 million pesetas ($1 million) from Japanese club Jef United, Spanish newspapers reported on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
